LUMIVAARA FREIGHT - ASIA TO NORTHERN EUROPE, NOVEMBER 2026

Dear customer, here is our monthly look at the sea and air freight market.

SEA FREIGHT
Carriers keep routing Asia to Europe services around the Cape of Good Hope. D=
oor to door from Vietnam and Taiwan to Southern Finland takes 42 to 50 days. =
Our weekly LCL consolidations from Ho Chi Minh City and Kaohsiung continue as=
 planned.

PEAK SEASON
Most carriers apply a peak season surcharge on Far East to North Europe until=
 further notice. For LCL we pass on EUR 6 per cbm. Contract rates with a fixe=
d validity are not affected.

AIR FREIGHT
